• What are all your current medications, including herb and vitamin supplements?
Mental Health Questions
• Do you have any history of or current treatment for psychological, mood, or anxiety
disorders?
• What mental health, nervous, or psychiatric conditions apply to you (e.g., situational
anxiety, adjustment disorder, panic disorder, depression, major depression, schizophrenia,
bipolar I or II, ADHD/ADD, eating disorder, mental retardation, PTSD, Tourette’s
syndrome, suicide attempt/ideation, OCD, autism)?
• Have you been diagnosed with Mild or Situational Depression or Anxiety within the last
6 months, or been hospitalized for it?
• What are the details of your current prescription medications for this condition (names,
dosage, frequency)?
• When was the condition diagnosed, and when were you last seen for it?
• Within the past 5 years, have you seen a psychiatrist or had treatment as a hospital
outpatient?
• Within the past 5 years, have you been an in-patient at a hospital or clinic?
• Within the past 5 years, have you been unable to work due to your condition?
• Have you had any suicidal thoughts?
• Have you attempted suicide? (If yes, provide details, including date and follow-up
treatment).
Nicotine/Smoking Use Questions
• Has the proposed insured used nicotine, tobacco, vape, or e-cigarettes within the past 12
months, 3 years, or 5 years? (excluding occasional cigar or pipe use)? (Note: Tobacco in
any form includes cigarettes, electronic cigarettes/e-cigs, chewing tobacco, cigars, pipes,
snuff, nicotine patch, nicotine gum/aerosol/inhaler, Hookah pipe, clove, bidis cigarettes,
or oral nicotine pouches.)
• During the past 36 months, have you used tobacco or nicotine products in any form
(excluding occasional cigar or pipe use)?
• Have you used tobacco or any nicotine products in any form within the past twelve (12)
months? (If Yes, type and amount, if No, date last used.)
Alcohol Use Questions
• Within the past 7 years, have you abused alcohol or had, or been recommended to have,
treatment or counseling for alcohol use, or been advised to discontinue use of alcohol?
--- PAGE 4 (2661 chars) ---
• Within the past 5 years, have you abused alcohol or drugs, or had or been recommended
by a medical professional or a licensed counselor to discontinue the use of alcohol or to
have treatment or counseling for alcohol?
• In the past 10 years, have you been treated for alcohol abuse?
• Do you have any history of alcohol abuse, misuse, treatment, or counseling, or having
been advised to discontinue the use of alcohol?
• Have you ever had any alcohol/drug related infractions? (Including a history of excessive
use of alcohol, or admitted DWI or DUI within the last three years).
Risky Behavior / Avocation Questions
• Within the past 12 months, have you made any flights as a pilot, student pilot, or crew
member of any aircraft?
• Within the past 24 months, have you made or contemplated making any flights as a pilot,
student pilot, or crew member of any aircraft?
• Do you expect to fly in the future within the next two years? (If Yes, indicate whether the
type of flying will differ from past flying and provide details).
• What type of certificate or license do you have now (Student, Private, Commercial, ATP,
Other)?
• Have you ever had an aircraft accident, been grounded, fined or reprimanded for
violation of air regulations?
• Provide the total of all hours flown as: (a) pilot (b) crew member, and a complete
schedule of flying time (Commercial, Company-owned, Student Instruction, Pleasure,
Military Combat/Non-Combat, etc.).
• Provide details of any other flying not specifically classified above (i.e. crop dusting,
mapping, surveying, testing) and type of aircraft flown (i.e. glider, helicopter, lighter-
than-air).
• Within the past 2 years (or next 2 years intend to participate), have you participated in
parachuting, hang gliding, rock or mountain climbing, rodeo events, sky diving, skin or
scuba diving, organized racing of any kind, or any professional sport?
• For how many years have you been climbing regularly, and how often do you climb?
• Do you climb in any of the following areas: North America (Mt McKinley or elsewhere),
Europe (Alps), Africa, Himalayas/Karakoram, or other areas?
• What is the nature of your climbing: Type of terrain (rock, snow/ice, artificial), degree of
difficulty (easy, moderate, difficult, severe, technical grade), maximum height climbed
to, and season(s) of the year?
• What proportion of your climbing is on routes protected by climbing bolts?
• Do you ever climb alone or without a rope? (If Yes, state how often, the location, and
degree of difficulty).
• Have you engaged in, or do you within the next 2 years intend on engaging in, any of
following forms of racing: Automobile or Hydroplane?
--- PAGE 5 (2244 chars) ---
• Over what type of track do you race? (e.g., oval, simulated road).
• Do you race professionally or for cash prizes?
• Provide the date of your last race.
• Are you a certified skin/scuba diver? (If Yes, provide hours of instruction and date of
certification. If No, why?)
• What is the maximum depth obtained on your dives? (Specify Pleasure or Commercial,
number of dives, and average time underwater for less than 40ft, 40-60ft, 60-100ft, and
100+ ft in the last 12 months and contemplated next 12 months).
• What types of equipment do you use? (Scuba, number of tanks, type of air supply, wet
suit, others).
• What are the locations of your diving activities? (Lakes and Rivers, Ocean Beaches,
Deep Sea, Bays and Inlets, or Others).
• Do you dive for salvage or exploration?
• Are you a member of an organized club for your climbing or diving activities?
Driving Record Questions
• Do you currently have a valid driver’s license?
• Within the past 24 months, have you had your driver’s license suspended or revoked, or
been convicted of driving under the influence of alcohol or drugs?
• Within the past 5 years, have you had a driver’s license suspended or revoked, or is your
