• Within the past 5 years, have you been convicted of careless or reckless driving?
• In the past 5 years, have you had more than two moving motor vehicle violations or any
alcohol/drug related infractions?
• Have you ever had any motor vehicle accidents? (If yes, provide details, including fault).
Arrest/Criminal Record Questions
• Within the past 6 months, have you served or been released from incarceration,
probation, parole, or other court-ordered supervision for a misdemeanor or felony
