Bankruptcy Questions
• Have you or your spouse filed bankruptcy before? If so, what type?
• If Chapter 7, was this personal or business?
• Has this bankruptcy been discharged?
• What was the date or anticipated date of discharge?
• Is this bankruptcy still in process?
Illegal Drug Use Questions
• Within the past 2 years, have you used illegal drugs, abused alcohol or drugs, had or been
